a href=\"/wiki/Markoheshkir\" title=\"Markoheshkir\"> <span style=\"color: #B7861D ;\">Markoheshkir</span> </a>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Main_Hand_Melee\" title=\"Main Hand Melee\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png/25px-Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png/38px-Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png/50px-Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Main Hand Melee\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png/25px-Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2b/Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Main_Hand_Melee\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Main Hand Melee\">Main Hand Melee</a>&nbsp;(<a href=\"/wiki/Quarterstaves\" title=\"Quarterstaves\">Quarterstaff</a>)\n</td>\n<td><dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Enchantment_(%2B1)\" title=\"Arcane Enchantment (+1)\">Arcane Enchantment</a></dt><dd>You gain a +1 bonus to <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Save_DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell Save DC\">Spell Save DC</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Attack\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell Attack\">Spell Attack</a> rolls.</dd></dl>\n<dl><dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Battery\" title=\"Arcane Battery\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Arcane_Battery_Passive_Feature_Icon.webp/40px-Arcane_Battery_Passive_Feature_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Arcane_Battery_Passive_Feature_Icon.webp/60px-Arcane_Battery_Passive_Featu