eneric_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Reverberation\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Reverberation_(Condition)\" title=\"Reverberation (Condition)\">Reverberation</a> on the target(s).</dd></dl>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Items_that_interact_with_Reverberation\">Items that interact with Reverberation</span></h2>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r243549\">\n<table class=\"wikitable defaultleft col1center sortable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:160px\">Name\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:220px\">Slot\n</th>\n<th>Effect\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\" style=\"width: 50px; height: 50px; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ring_of_Absolute_Force\" title=\"Ring of Absolute Force\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Ring_of_Absolute_Force_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Ring_of_Absolute_Force_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/a/a3/Ring_of_Absolute_Force_Unfaded_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Ring_of_Absolute_Force_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Ring_of_Absolute_Force_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a3/Ring_of_Absolute_Force_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></s